l_kind\">partial def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lake/Util/IO.html#Lake.removeDirAllIfExists\"><span class=\"name\">Lake</span>.<span class=\"name\">removeDirAllIfExists</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">path</span> : <a href=\"./Init/System/FilePath.html#System.FilePath\">System.FilePath</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/System/IO.html#IO\">IO</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Unit\">Unit</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Remove a directory and all its contents.\nLike `IO.FS.removeDirAll`, but does not fail if `path` does not exist\nor if a file is first deleted by a racing process.\n","docLink":"./Lake/Util/IO.html#Lake.removeDirAllIfExists","kind":"opaque","line":83,"name":"Lake.removeDirAllIfExists","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/lake/Lake/Util/IO.lean#L83-L103"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lake/Util/IO.html#Lake.writeBinFileAtomicIfNew\"><span class=\"name\">Lake</span>.<span class=\"name\">writeBinFileAtomicIfNew</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">path</span> : <a href=\"./Init/System/FilePath.html#System.FilePath\">System.FilePath</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">content</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#ByteArray\">ByteArray</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/System/IO.html#IO\">IO</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Unit\">Unit</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Produces a file at `path` with its full `content` in one atomic operation.\nTo do so, it writes the content to `.part.tmp` file and then renames it to the destination.\n